│ T1: Goroutine spawned (detached)                          │
│ T2: Function returns nil                                   │
│ T3: Transaction endorsement completes                      │
│ T4: Stub context closed/invalidated                        │
│ T5: Goroutine attempts SetEvent() ← UNDEFINED BEHAVIOR    │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

