### 4. Missing Duplicate Vote Prevention

| Attribute | Details |
|-----------|---------|
| **Type** | Access Control / Business Logic Flaw |
| **Severity** | High |
| **Location** | `CastVote()` function, lines 43-62 |

**Description:**
The function appends voters to a list but never checks if the voter has already voted. This allows vote manipulation.

```go
// No check for existing voter
proposal.VoteCount++
proposal.Voters = append(proposal.Voters, voterID)
```

**Recommended Fix:**
```go
func (v *VotingContract) CastVote(ctx contractapi.TransactionContextInterface, proposalID string, voterID string) error {
    // ... existing validation ...

    // Check for duplicate vote
    for _, existingVoter := range proposal.Voters {
        if existingVoter == voterID {
            return fmt.Errorf("voter %s has already voted on proposal %s", voterID, proposalID)
        }
    }

    proposal.VoteCount++
    proposal.Voters = append(proposal.Voters, voterID)
    // ...
}
```

