|-----------|---------|
| **Type** | Phantom Read / TOCTOU (Time-of-Check to Time-of-Use) |
| **Severity** | **High** |
| **Location** | `TransferWithBalanceCheck()` function, lines 119-148 |
| **CWE** | CWE-367 (Time-of-check Time-of-use Race Condition) |

